                        00009         ; Revision date: Nov/24/2019. Builds a world. Added evil cubes, and
                        00010         ;                             can shoot them. 517 bytes.
                        00011         ; Revision date: Nov/25/2019. Optimized last bytes. 509 bytes.
                        00012         ;
                        00013 
                        00014         ;
                        00015         ; Tricks used:
